        "portland:title-33/page-289",
        "portland:title-33/page-290",
        "portland:title-33/page-291",
        "ors:197A.425"
      ],
      "finding": "Table 205-2's text projection reads R5: 3,000 sq ft for two ADUs, with at least one detached and specified street-frontage qualifications. Size is the lesser of 75% of the primary unit or 800 sq ft, subject to the five-year basement-conversion exception. Visitability rules and exemptions continue on pages 290-291. ORS 197A.425 requires at least one ADU in its specified city/county/UGB scope and excludes owner-occupancy/additional parking from reasonable siting/design rules, with a vacation-occupancy exception.",
      "omissions": [
        "PDF table/figure not visually verified; no parcel geometry or permit conclusion.",
        "Base-zone primary-structure/covered-accessory standards were not fully researched.",
        "ORS 2025 edition excludes 2025 special-session and 2026 regular-session changes; later city ordinances not consolidated."
      ]
    },
