      "evidence_keys": [
        "fl:stat/83.49",
        "fl:stat/83.42",
        "fl:stat/83.505"
      ],
      "finding": "Section 83.49(3) distinguishes 15-day no-claim return from 30-day claim notice, and a 15-day tenant objection period after receipt. Email depends on 83.505's voluntary signed addendum and delivery/recordkeeping rules. The fewer-than-five-units exception is to subsection (2), not a blanket exemption from deposit duties. Section 83.49(4)-(5) and Part II exclusions in 83.42 require checking. Printed citations were followed manually because references were empty. Annual edition 2026 has no snapshot/effective date; the date-cutoff attempt cannot answer historical law.",
      "omissions": [
        "No case-specific termination, notice receipt, subsidized-housing, lease, or litigation analysis.",
        "No session-law/effective-date reconstruction; a null-dated edition is excluded by as_of."
      ]
    },
