      "finding": "No such inference follows from the retained sources. Section 3615 preserves same-rights state/local law but invalidates contrary permission to the extent of a federal discriminatory housing practice. Section 3603(b) expressly preserves 3604(c)'s advertisement rule even for its owner-occupied four-family exemption. Florida 760.23(3) and 760.29 contain their own prohibition and detailed exemptions. The repaired 3603-to-3604(c) link verifies the exact USLM identifier and returns the enclosing section, not an invented standalone subsection.",
